@baseUrl = http://localhost:5101

### All products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products

### Batch lookup (used by Orders in Sprint 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?ids=b1f0c8a2-4c1e-4b7e-9a51-0f6d2c3a1001&ids=b1f0c8a2-4c1e-4b7e-9a51-0f6d2c3a1003

### One product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/b1f0c8a2-4c1e-4b7e-9a51-0f6d2c3a1001

### Unknown product -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness (fails when PostgreSQL is down)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
